LAMMPS (29 Aug 2024)
# ==========================================================
# Coordination numbers
# ==========================================================

units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      charge

read_data       glass_final_300K.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (4.8951235 4.8951235 4.8951235) to (48.987588 48.987588 48.987588)
  1 by 2 by 2 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  6480 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  6480 velocities
  read_data CPU = 0.046 seconds

# ---------------- Force field ----------------

pair_style hybrid/overlay pedone 15.0 coul/long 15.0
kspace_style pppm 1.0e-6

pair_coeff * * coul/long

pair_coeff 1 2 pedone 0.340554 2.006700 2.100000 1.0
pair_coeff 2 2 pedone 0.042395 2.047400 3.600000 22.0
pair_coeff 2 3 pedone 0.100261 2.765800 3.300000 5.0

pair_modify mix geometric

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

# ---------------- Short averaging ----------------

velocity all create 300.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

fix nvt all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1

# ---------------- Coordination ----------------

compute SiO all coord/atom cutoff 2.325 2
compute CaO all coord/atom cutoff 3.00 2

dump coord all custom 10000 coordination.dump id type c_SiO c_CaO

thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe press

run 10000

